{
  "name": "Enrich new Pipedrive people with title, company and profile in a note",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Enrich new Pipedrive people with title, company and profile in a note\n\n### How it works\nContext on every new Pipedrive person. The Pipedrive Trigger fires when a person is added. The workflow takes the primary email and asks Argorant for the person behind it. When a match with a passing email is found, a note pinned to the person lists job title, seniority, company, location and profile URL, and the person's name is filled in when Pipedrive only had the email. People without a match stay as they are.\n\nCosts: 1 credit per match; misses are free.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the community node **n8n-nodes-argorant** (tested with 0.3.0 on n8n 2.46.6): Settings > Community nodes > Install. Guide: https://github.com/argorant/n8n-nodes-argorant\n2. Add an **Argorant API** credential with a key from Argorant (Settings, API keys).\n3. Add a Pipedrive credential to **Person added**, **Pin a note** and **Fill the name**.\n4. Activate the workflow.\n\n### Customization\nWrite the title into a custom person field instead of a note.",
        "height": 558,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 1
      },
